[00:18.76]How great is the honor, Jehovah,
[00:23.90]To build you a place for your name!
[00:30.42]We offer it now with rejoicing
[00:35.68]To add to your glory and fame.
[00:42.40]Whatever the things we may give you,
[00:48.46]They rightly were yours from the start.
[00:53.96]Our labor, our skill, our possessions,
[01:00.38]We joyfully give from the heart.
[01:05.85](Chorus)
[01:06.00]May we present this place to you,
[01:12.46]And here may your name be known.
[01:18.00]We dedicate this place to you;
[01:23.94]Please accept it as your own.
[01:30.12]And now may we honor you, Father,
[01:32.89]By filling this place with your praise.
[01:36.45]May glory ascend with the increase
[01:39.67]Of those who are learning your ways.
[01:42.89]Committing this place to your worship,
[01:46.45]We give it our generous care.
[01:49.00]And long may it stand as a witness,
[01:52.02]Supporting the message we bear.
[01:54.27](Chorus)
[01:54.42]May we present this place to you,
[01:58.54]And here may your name be known.
[02:12.44]We dedicate this place to you;
[02:18.54]Please accept it as your own.
